"(e.g. Debian, Ubuntu or RHEL). Such packages are often patched without "
"changing the version number, so your server may already be protected. Please"
" ask your hosting provider whether the security updates of 21 October 2026 "
"for CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619 have been applied."
msgstr ""

